        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw Sword is a highly creative Vampire Survivors-like action roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control an adorable little bean, drawing its movement paths by hand to determine how it moves and attacks, carving out a slim chance of survival amid swarming enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stroke becomes a real movement trajectory and attack path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your direction in advance, weave through enemy formations, or precisely eliminate high-threat targets — every decision is yours to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trajectory as Blade — Draw Your Path of Attack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/f17cc95c96bb15fcbcc51317533c4db9.poster.avif?t=1786497518\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/f17cc95c96bb15fcbcc51317533c4db9.webm?t=1786497518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/f17cc95c96bb15fcbcc51317533c4db9.mp4?t=1786497518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-draw your route; the bean moves along it and attacks automatically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each designed path is a tactical choice between offense and retreat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use physics collisions and momentum to create combos and fluid movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One stroke can decide life or death — precision determines the battlefield</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Items — Build Diverse Combat Styles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/798d316d40d62b40538e204e9dc3145d.poster.avif?t=1786497518\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/798d316d40d62b40538e204e9dc3145d.webm?t=1786497518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of weapons and items to freely combine into unique builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face various monsters and increasingly intense waves of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and enhance abilities to shape your own growth path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold and purchase equipment to construct your personal combat style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wave Survival — Precision Decisions Within Limited Actions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/e891142d25faff0fb65f4f292fa9ace9.poster.avif?t=1786497518\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/e891142d25faff0fb65f4f292fa9ace9.webm?t=1786497518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/e891142d25faff0fb65f4f292fa9ace9.mp4?t=1786497518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy waves continue until your action count runs out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate as many enemies as possible within limited turns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and strengthen attributes to increase combat power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek the optimal solution under pressure and survive to the very end</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw Sword is a highly creative Vampire Survivors-like action roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control an adorable little bean, drawing its movement paths by hand to determine how it moves and attacks, carving out a slim chance of survival amid swarming enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stroke becomes a real movement trajectory and attack path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your direction in advance, weave through enemy formations, or precisely eliminate high-threat targets — every decision is yours to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trajectory as Blade — Draw Your Path of Attack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/f17cc95c96bb15fcbcc51317533c4db9.poster.avif?t=1786497518\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/f17cc95c96bb15fcbcc51317533c4db9.webm?t=1786497518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886770/extras/f17cc95c96bb15fcbcc51317533c4db9.mp4?t=1786497518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-draw your route; the bean moves along it and attacks automatically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each designed path is a tactical choice between offense and retreat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use physics collisions and momentum to create combos and fluid movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One stroke can decide life or death — precision determines the battlefield</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Items — Build Diverse Combat Styles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class